        "id": 131784,
        "name": "Silverleaf",
        "username": "Silverleaf",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-18T19:20:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"jffdougan\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/48/1882_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jffdougan:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Donner: Thanks for mentioning religion in your list. I'm an atheist in a (blood) family that is definitely Christian, a few of whom are evangelical. They're aware that I stopped attending church a long time ago, but it's a closet I'm not otherwise out of yet to them.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Interesting. What consequences do you expect if/when you tell them?</p>\n<p>Also, atheist solidarity! Someone once told me in confusion, \"But you don't&nbsp;<em>look</em>&nbsp;like an atheist…\" as if we all have devil horns or something. He seemed genuinely concerned that I could not be a good person and was essentially a ticking time bomb who would inevitably start torture babies and eating kittens and having sex with mosquitoes without the threat of eternal punishment in hell to keep me in check.</p>",
